---
// Farewell.astro — Colophon / Closing Page
---

<section id="farewell" aria-label="Penutup Jurnal">
  <div class="farewell-bg" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <div class="farewell-content">
    <!-- Large decorative roman numeral -->
    <div class="farewell-chapter-num reveal">V</div>

    <!-- Chapter eyebrow -->
    <p class="chapter-eyebrow reveal delay-1" style="justify-content:center;">
      <span class="orn">❧</span>
      Epilog — Penutup Jurnal
    </p>

    <h2 class="section-heading reveal delay-2" style="text-align:center; margin-top:var(--sp-4);">
      Sampai Jumpa,<br>
      <em>Desa Angsana</em>
    </h2>

    <div class="farewell-deco-line reveal delay-3"></div>

    <blockquote class="farewell-quote reveal delay-4">
      Pergi ke desa untuk mengabdi,<br>
      tapi justru kami yang paling banyak belajar.<br>
      Terima kasih telah menjadi rumah kami.
    </blockquote>

    <div class="farewell-deco-line reveal delay-5"></div>

    <!-- Colophon -->
    <div class="farewell-footer reveal delay-6">
      <p>KKN Kelompok 02 · Universitas Lambung Mangkurat</p>
      <p style="margin-top:var(--sp-2); opacity:0.7;">Desa Angsana · 13 Juli – 15 Agustus 2026</p>
      <div style="margin-top:var(--sp-5); display:flex; justify-content:center; gap:var(--sp-2); flex-wrap:wrap;">
        <span class="badge badge-crimson">ULM</span>
        <span class="badge badge-gold">2026</span>
        <span class="badge badge-sepia">Desa Angsana</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="farewell-colophon reveal delay-6">
      Dibuat dengan 🌿 kenangan &amp; ❤️ hati · Jurnal KKN © 2026
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
